        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵamŵilasile mcanda juŵanyakwile yida yakwe ni ŵamlamwile kuti, “Jigalani upanga wenu mumbulaje. Ngingusosa ŵandu tajileje kuti nawulajidwe ni jwamkongwe!” Nipo mcandajo ŵamsomile ni lipanga Abimeleki, mwakuti lipangalyo lyakopocele ku mgongo nipo ŵawile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.54",
